handNote.seg:
Incipits (one word to one or several lines, consecutive or alternating with black lines in different groupings);
captions of miniatures; holy names; the names of individuals related to the production of
the manuscript; elements of the punctuation signs, text dividers, and numerals.

decoNote.desc:
Three scenes: ʾAragāwi, identified by the caption አባ፡ አረጋዊ።, meets his mother; 
                                    Theodore ordains her as a nun; and introduces her to a monastic
                                    group of nuns.
